Subject: [PATCH 550/550] [Spec] Copy drafts benchmark: the copy kernels and
 verification at the lookahead

CUDA-graph timings with the L2 flushed: copy_match and copy_select for 1, 8 and
16 requests over 4K to 1M-token contexts, the history in UVA and in device
memory, gated at 1% of the release suite's step at that concurrency; greedy and
block verification compiled at the copy lookahead (16) against the block (5)
on DSpark's 6-row steps (the same commits; gated: no slower), and the wide
steps of one 17-row request beside them.
